  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Colombia Peace Programme Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective is to strengthen peace and reconciliation processes through citizen participation and social fabric restoration in the framework of theTotal Peace Policy. 

The outcomes of the project are:

1. The Catholic Church accompanies the diverse dialogue and participation scenarios, as well as the initiatives for the implementation of the Total Peace Policy.

2. Civil Society sectors participate in an informed and safe manner in the initiatives and mechanisms arising from Colombia&apos;s Peace Policy.

3. Members of civil society organizations show an improvement in social cohesion and a positive effect on the solution of common needs and problems through collaborative work and strategic alliances.</narrative>
  </description>
